---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar';
import Footer from '../components/Footer';
import AudioPlayerWidget from '../components/AudioPlayerWidget';
---

<Layout 
	title="Privacy Policy - Dino Run Epochs"
	description="Privacy Policy for Dino Run Epochs. Details on how we collect, store, and process user data, analytics, cookies, and Google AdSense third-party advertising in compliance with GDPR and CCPA."
	canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
	<Navbar pathname={Astro.url.pathname} client:load />
	
	<main class="w-full pt-32 pb-20 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-[1000px] mx-auto text-slate-200">
		<header class="mb-12 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/5 text-amber-400 text-xs font-['Geist_Mono'] font-medium mb-4">
				COMPLIANCE & TRANSPARENCY
			</div>
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-['Chakra_Petch'] uppercase">
				Privacy <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-orange-400">Policy</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-3 text-slate-400 text-sm font-['Geist_Mono']">
				Last Updated: August 31, 2026 • Version 2.1
			</p>
		</header>

		<article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 leading-relaxed font-['Outfit'] text-slate-300 text-base">
			
			<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-amber-200 text-sm leading-relaxed">
				<strong>Summary:</strong> Dino Run Epochs respects your privacy. We do not require you to create an account, enter personal identifiers, or make payments to play. Our game client runs locally in your browser via WebAssembly. We use cookies and local storage exclusively for gameplay high score tracking, performance metrics, and third-party advertising services such as Google AdSense.
			</div>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">1. Information We Collect</h2>
				<p>When you visit and interact with Dino Run Epochs (<a href="https://dinorunepochs.com" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">dinorunepochs.com</a>), we and our service providers may collect certain technical and usage information:</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
					<li><strong>Gameplay Data & High Scores:</strong> High scores, unlocked biomes, and audio preferences are stored directly on your device using browser <code class="text-amber-300 bg-white/5 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">localStorage</code>. This data never leaves your computer or browser environment.</li>
					<li><strong>Technical Log Data:</strong> Like most web applications, our web hosting provider (Vercel) automatically logs device type, browser user-agent, operating system, IP address, referral URLs, and access timestamps to detect malicious attacks and diagnose network performance.</li>
					<li><strong>Anonymized Web Analytics:</strong> We use privacy-friendly analytics (Vercel Web Analytics & Speed Insights) to evaluate page load latencies and Core Web Vitals. No personal identifiers or cross-site tracking fingerprints are captured.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">2. Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising</h2>
				<p>We partner with Google AdSense to serve advertisements when you visit our website. Google and its certified third-party ad networks use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites across the internet:</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
					<li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to your sites and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
					<li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">Ads Settings</a>.</li>
					<li>Alternatively, you can opt out of third-party vendor cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">www.aboutads.info/choices/</a>.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">3. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
				<p>Cookies are small text files placed on your computer by websites that you visit. Dino Run Epochs uses essential local storage keys to preserve your sound mute toggle, preferred epoch theme, and highest achieved survival score.</p>
				<p>You can configure your browser to reject all cookies or notify you when a cookie is being set. However, if you disable local storage, your game high scores and volume preferences will reset each time you refresh the tab.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">4. General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) Rights</h2>
				<p>If you reside in the European Economic Area (EEA) or United Kingdom, you possess statutory data rights under the GDPR:</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
					<li>The right to access, rectify, or erase any personal information we hold about you.</li>
					<li>The right to restrict or object to our processing of your personal data.</li>
					<li>The right to data portability and the right to withdraw cookie consent at any time.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>Because we do not store customer accounts or user identity databases, we retain no personally identifiable database records.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">5. California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA / CPRA)</h2>
				<p>For California residents, the California Consumer Privacy Act grants you the right to know what personal information is collected, request deletion, and opt out of the sale or sharing of your personal data. Dino Run Epochs does not sell personal data to third parties for monetary consideration.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">6. Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA)</h2>
				<p>Dino Run Epochs is designed as a family-friendly arcade game for general audiences. We do not knowingly collect or solicit personal information from children under the age of 13. If you believe that a minor has provided us with personal information, please contact us immediately so we can take appropriate measures.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">7. Contact the Privacy Team</h2>
				<p>If you have any questions, clarifications, or requests concerning this Privacy Policy, please reach out to us at:</p>
				<div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-white/10 font-['Geist_Mono'] text-sm space-y-1">
					<p><strong class="text-white">Dino Run Epochs Studio</strong></p>
					<p>Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@dinorunepochs.com" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">privacy@dinorunepochs.com</a></p>
					<p>Support Contact Page: <a href="/contact" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">dinorunepochs.com/contact</a></p>
				</div>
			</section>

		</article>
	</main>

	<AudioPlayerWidget client:load />
	<Footer client:visible />
</Layout>
